{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d108cbad5854f4f9edcf1f7f4b32cfc3.poster.avif?t=1766564297\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d108cbad5854f4f9edcf1f7f4b32cfc3.webm?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d108cbad5854f4f9edcf1f7f4b32cfc3.mp4?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are one of the many Test-Bots built by the facility. They promise you freedom if you experiment with a special type of lava they have found, you must avoid the dangers that come with it though. But the question is..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>can you trust the facility?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each Death Is One Step Closer To Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every time you die, you will be able to read reports by the staff monitoring on how you died and what you died to, you will also learn how to avoid the cause of death for your next playthrough. Most of the times you will earn an<strong> Entity File</strong>\u00a0which allows you to learn more about what you died to. Sometimes you may get them for meeting a new<strong> entity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/6647c8f381df0b10c9bd8c01eb270f7a.poster.avif?t=1766564297\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/6647c8f381df0b10c9bd8c01eb270f7a.webm?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/6647c8f381df0b10c9bd8c01eb270f7a.mp4?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Room Generation</strong>:\u00a0Every run will be different from the others, whether its when threats spawn or the chambers you must complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Unique Puzzles:</strong>\u00a0Some puzzles may simply require a box to be sitting on a pressure pad,<i> but others will require far more unique actions involving the lava</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Story:</strong> Experience an interesting story unfold as you play through the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Paintings</strong>: Submit your own art in our Discord server and have it featured in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-Based Narrative:</strong> The game is separated into 3 chapters which involve introductions to unique mechanics and fun elements as the game goes on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.poster.avif?t=1766564297\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.webm?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.mp4?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>This game wouldn't have been made if it wasn't for these amazing games inspiring me</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DOORS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal 1 &amp; 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karlson</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681650?t=1766564297","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/cfdd46b65e9976927b03bdc3e5dbca63a85a77a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766564297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/f6872c72304dbc6b079e2bc76f57a664a21c9317/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766564297","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/f6872c72304dbc6b079e2bc76f57a664a21c9317/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766564297","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d108cbad5854f4f9edcf1f7f4b32cfc3.poster.avif?t=1766564297\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d108cbad5854f4f9edcf1f7f4b32cfc3.webm?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d108cbad5854f4f9edcf1f7f4b32cfc3.mp4?t=1766564297\" type=\"v