n and Unique Puzzles:</strong>\u00a0Some puzzles may simply require a box to be sitting on a pressure pad,<i> but others will require far more unique actions involving the lava</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Story:</strong> Experience an interesting story unfold as you play through the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Paintings</strong>: Submit your own art in our Discord server and have it featured in the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapter-Based Narrative:</strong> The game is separated into 3 chapters which involve introductions to unique mechanics and fun elements as the game goes on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.poster.avif?t=1766564297\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.webm?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/extras/d7815927c7910566f470347480d4471b.mp4?t=1766564297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>This game wouldn't have been made if it wasn't for these amazing games inspiring me</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DOORS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portal 1 &amp; 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karlson</p></li></ul>","developers":["Frizz","Luna"],"dlc":[3682490],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681650/8539a995126d7b86cbeddfc608f7